# Uldaros Theorix: the copy he casts is a spell, and it can be countered. Bot1 Entombs The Theorist, Jace Beleren, then exiles it
# with Black Lotus, and casts a copy of Jace; Bot2 counters that spell with Counterspell. A copy of a card that leaves the stack
# ceases to exist (CR 707.10a): no token Jace, and no card in the graveyard; the exiled Jace stays in exile.

